{
  "slug": "html-skills",
  "name": "Html Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for Claude Code that make it output HTML files instead of plain markdown when HTML is the better fit — specs, system diagrams, ERDs, dashboards, slide decks, design tokens, code reviews, timelines, and more.\n\nSix of the skills are interactive: you click around in your browser, hit Submit, and the result comes straight back into the same Claude Code session as a notification.\n\nNo copying, no pasting, no switching windows.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `html-architecture-diagrams` (Create HTML system architecture diagrams — microservice maps, dependency graphs, deployment topologies, data ownership maps, integration diagrams), `html-brainstorm-grid` (**TRIGGER: about to populate `AskUserQuestion` options with `preview:` content for any visual / UX / layout / screen…), `html-code-review` (Generate HTML artifacts for code review, PR explanation, and codebase understanding — rendered diffs with inline annotations, severity-coded…), `html-comparison-matrix` (**TRIGGER: about to populate `AskUserQuestion` options with `preview:` content for any comparison heavier than 2-3 short text labels…), `html-data-explorer` (Build HTML data explorers for CSV, JSON, log, and event data — filterable tables, faceted search, inline charts,…), `html-design-prototypes` (**TRIGGER: about to populate `AskUserQuestion` options with `preview:` content for any visual UI / screen / layout /…), `html-design-tokens` (Showcase design tokens — color palettes, type scales, spacing systems, radius scales, shadow systems, motion tokens — as…), `html-erd-explorer` (Generate HTML entity-relationship diagrams (ERDs) and database schema visualizations with clickable tables, relationship paths, and migration before/after views), and 11 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install html-skills@claude-community` from `f-labs-io/agent-html-skills` (`plugins/html-skills`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
